Project Overview

A simulated consulting engagement focused on helping a mid-sized retail company improve sales performance, supplier relationships, and customer satisfaction through AI-assisted business analysis.

The objective was to transform raw operational data into executive-level insights and actionable business recommendations using Generative AI and structured prompting techniques.

Business Problem

The client identified three critical business challenges:

Identify the highest and lowest performing product categories.
Determine which suppliers contribute the greatest business value.
Identify products receiving the lowest customer ratings to improve customer satisfaction.

The goal was to provide leadership with data-driven recommendations that support strategic decision-making.

My Role

I designed an AI-assisted workflow that combined spreadsheet analysis with prompt engineering to produce executive-ready business deliverables.

Responsibilities included:

Designing structured prompts
Performing business analysis
Creating executive summaries
Developing presentation materials
Producing management recommendations
Refining outputs through iterative prompting
AI Workflow
